            "Locations found in"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Goblin_skull\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Goblin_skull.png?74e3d\" alt=\"Goblin skull.png: RS3 Inventory image of Goblin skull\" width=\"22\" height=\"24\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Goblin_skull\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Goblin skull</a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Goblin_(monster)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Goblin</a>",
              "• East of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/River_Lum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">River Lum</a> in Lumbridge<br>• Near the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Draynor_lodestone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Draynor lodestone</a> and the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Wizard%27s_Tower\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wizard&#39;s Tower</a><br>• East of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Barbarian_Village\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Barbarian Village</a> and south-west of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Grand_Exchange\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Grand Exchange</a><br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Stronghold_of_Security\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stronghold of Security</a><br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Goblin_Village\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Goblin Village</a><br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Port_Sarim\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Port Sarim</a><br>• By the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Coal_truck_mine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Coal truck mine</a> and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Hemenster\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hemenster</a><br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Goblin_Cave\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Goblin Cave</a><br>• Around the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Varrock_Dig_Site\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Varrock Dig Site</a><br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/God_Wars_Dungeon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">God Wars Dungeon</a>"
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Bear_ribs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Bear_ribs.png?694f3\" alt=\"Bear ribs.png: RS3 Inventory image of Bear ribs\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Bear_ribs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bear ribs</a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Bear\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bear</a> and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Black_bear\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Black bear</a>",
              "• Directly east of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Captured_Temple\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Captured Temple</a><br>• South of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mind_altar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mind altar</a><br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Legends%27_Guild_south-west_mine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Legends&#39; Guild south-west mine</a> (<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fairy_ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fairy ring</a> code <b>B</b><b>L</b><b>R</b>)<br>• South of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fruit_tree_patch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fruit tree patch</a> by the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Tree_Gnome_Village_(location)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tree Gnome Village</a><br>• East of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Rellekka\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rellekka</a>"
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Big_frog_leg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Big_frog_leg.png?5d786\" alt=\"Big frog leg.png: RS3 Inventory image of Big frog leg\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Big_frog_leg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Big frog leg</a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Big_frog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Big Frog</a>",
              "• Inside of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lumbridge_Swamp_Caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lumbridge Swamp Caves</a> in the area in the south-east corner<br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Dorgesh-Kaan_South_Dungeon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dorgesh-Kaan South Dungeon</a> (<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fairy_ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fairy ring</a> code <b>A</b><b>J</b><b>Q</b>)"
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ram_skull\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Ram_skull.png?46686\" alt=\"Ram skull.png: RS3 Inventory image of Ram skull\" width=\"24\" height=\"26\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ram_skull\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ram skull</a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ram</a>",
