              "• South of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Seers%27_Village\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Seers&#39; Village</a><br>• South of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Yanille\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yanille</a><br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ardougne_Zoo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ardougne Zoo</a> (<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fairy_ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fairy ring</a> code <b>B</b><b>I</b><b>S</b>)<br>• East of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Rellekka\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rellekka</a><br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Varrock_south-east_mine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Varrock south-east mine</a><br>• South of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Wilderness_Crater\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wilderness Crater</a>"
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Monkey_paw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Monkey_paw.png?d2f38\" alt=\"Monkey paw.png: RS3 Inventory image of Monkey paw\" width=\"29\" height=\"24\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Monkey_paw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Monkey paw</a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Monkey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Monkey</a>",
              "• North of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Karamja_lodestone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Karamja lodestone</a><br>• East of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Karamja_Volcano\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Karamja Volcano</a><br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ardougne_Zoo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ardougne Zoo</a> (must have level 33 Magic for <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Telekinetic_Grab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Telekinetic Grab</a>)<br>• Mos Le&#39;Harmless"
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Giant_rat_bone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Giant_rat_bone.png?0d041\" alt=\"Giant rat bone.png: RS3 Inventory image of Giant rat bone\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Giant_rat_bone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Giant rat bone</a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Giant_rat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Giant rat</a>",
              "• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Stronghold_of_Security\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stronghold of Security</a><br>• Behind the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Dancing_Donkey_Inn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dancing Donkey Inn</a> in south-east <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Varrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Varrock</a><br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Varrock_sewers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Varrock sewers</a><br>• South-west of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Port_Sarim\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Port Sarim</a><br>• Behind <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lumbridge_Castle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lumbridge Castle</a> and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lumbridge_swamp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lumbridge swamp</a><br>• In the pen south of Varrock<br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Edgeville_dungeon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Edgeville dungeon</a>"
